    "Description": "The util-linux packages contain a large variety of low-level system utilities that are necessary for a Linux system to function. Among others, these include the fdisk configuration tool and the login program.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* util-linux: util-linux: Partition metadata compromise via integer overflow in DOS partition parser (CVE-2026-53615)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.",
